# Local agent state. `.claude/worktrees/` accumulates whole checkouts with their
# own build output — tens of thousands of files — so a stray `git add -A` would
# otherwise commit hundreds of megabytes that are impossible to remove from
# history afterwards. Nothing in here is shared: `launch.json` names a Windows
# `pnpm.cmd`, so it would not work for anyone on another platform anyway.
.claude/
